    "title": "A torrent of writing advice",
    "subtitle": null,
    "author": "G.  Gayatri",
    "published_at": null,
    "image_url": null,
    "image_caption": null,
    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71682933\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p>Ever since I took up writing as a hobby, something curious has happened. Everyone around me has become my commissioning editor.</p><p>I am inundated with suggestions about what to write. My father, convinced that every human interest story deserves my views, forwards news clippings with the expectation that an essay will soon follow. Friends believe my pen, or rather my keyboard, should celebrate the unique bond between women. Then there are the worldly wise who feel that my profession, among many weighty matters, would benefit from my views.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 15, 2026 04:08 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71682933\" data-title=\"A torrent of writing advice\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/a-torrent-of-writing-advice/article71682933.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-27e32167385ea3752a1d828a-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/a-torrent-of-writing-advice/article71682933.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=A%20torrent%20of%20writing%20advice&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fopen-page%2Fa-torrent-of-writing-advice%2Farticle71682933.ece\" target=\"_self\">\n                    Email     \n                                \n                </